t;50 · 80 · 100% credit" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#7AA116;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.budgets_2;" vertex="1" parent="l_watch"><mxGeometry x="484" y="60" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sns" value="SNS&lt;br&gt;cảnh báo team" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#E7157B;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.sns;" vertex="1" parent="l_watch"><mxGeometry x="710" y="60" width="48" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Chưa chốt / còn thiếu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Chuyển ảnh sang Nhật: hồ sơ đánh giá gửi trong 60 ngày&lt;br&gt;từ lần chuyển đầu (Luật 91/2025, Điều 20)&lt;br&gt;• Ai xin đồng ý của chủ tiệm khi Datagent tự lắp&lt;br&gt;• Team là bên kiểm soát hay bên xử lý dữ liệu&lt;br&gt;• Không có hộp thì che mặt ngay khi ảnh tới cloud,&lt;br&gt;và phải báo Datagent là mặt người đã rời tiệm&lt;br&gt;• Ai giữ tài khoản AWS, credit cấp dưới dạng nào" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#fbe7d4,#3a2a16);strokeColor=#D79B00;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1511" y="90" width="320" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="later" value="&lt;b&gt;Thêm khi mở rộng quá đợt đầu&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Organizations + Control Tower:&lt;br&gt;Management, Log Archive, Audit, Prod, Dev&lt;br&gt;• SCP cấm tắt log, Region deny&lt;br&gt;• GuardDuty · Security Hub · Config&lt;br&gt;• Inspector · IAM Access Analyzer" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ffffff,#0f1620);strokeColor=#8593A3;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1511" y="300" width="320" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="__title" value="milk-camera — Bảo mật giai đoạn đầu (HOANG-P07, 07/11/2026)" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=light-dark(#232F3E,#E8E8E8);" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="24" width="1881" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ed1" value="SSO + MFA" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=light-dark(#1B2733,#CFE0F0);strokeColor=light-dark(#2D6A9F,#5B9BD5);strokeWidth=2;flowAnimation=1;labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#0B0F14);exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="team" target="sso"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="322" y="174"/><mxPoint x="322" y="294"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed2" value="mTLS · X.509" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=light-dark(#1B2733,#CFE0F0);strokeColor=light-dark(#2D6A9F,#5B9BD5);strokeWidth=2;flowAnimation=1;labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#0B0F14);exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="boxpc" target="iot"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="322" y="558"/><mxPoint x="322" y="678"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ed3" value="HTTPS + MFA" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=light-dark(#1B2733,#CF